{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"想靠近的心仍在、回应缺乏根据、失落留在身体里引发停顿，以及克制只能减轻靠近而不能使需要消失、坚持因此更加直接急迫，都能在H44、H45和M1中找到依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"前一轮的用力没有消除失去的可能或提供停下来的支点、持续承受使身体难以放松且急迫与郑重交织、反复的情绪起伏和既有疲惫使人更难分开处理感受，都能由H14、H18、H20、H21、H46及M35、M36支持。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"新增了向前行动本身会带来一点松动的因果效果，而H19、H20、H44、M14和原解释5只支持没有保证仍想靠近、坚定不能保证结果以及克制失效后投入变得更彻底、更危险，并未说明向前会缓解紧张或带来松动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"反复加力不能保证避免失去、先前的反复加力留下疲惫，以及犹疑的作用耗尽后只剩最强的动作倾向，都能在H18、H46、M37和原解释4中找到依据，因此将末尾描述为停滞稍稍松开属于对既有因果的具体化。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7d6a3c51-b723-4e16-916a-cff0d10f8e73", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134531525737Z", "elapsed_seconds": 173.203, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:48:24.748223+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "40463e72377d5c02d5308c28d32c2c564e17f7878504a72be9da90b29963e397", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_